{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24321","headline":"残春咏怀赠杨慕巢侍郎 · 白居易","name":"残春咏怀赠杨慕巢侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"位逾三品日，年过六旬时。\n不道官班下，其如筋力衰。\n犹怜好风景，转重旧亲知。\n少壮难重得，欢娱且强爲。\n兴来池上酌，醉出袖中诗。\n静话开襟久，闲吟放醆迟。\n落花无限雪，残鬓几多丝。\n莫说伤心事，春翁易酒悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24321.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24321","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}